  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven : 10 = 3 ÷ 2 - 5 + 1 × 11\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the signs :\n\nOption 1) × and =\n\n10 = 3 ÷ 2 - 5 + 1 × 11 ⇒ 10 × 3 ÷ 2 - 5 + 1 = 11\n\n⇒ 10 × __**3 ÷ 2**__ - 5 + 1 = 11\n\n⇒ __**10 ×**____** 1.5**__ - 5 + 1 = 11\n\n⇒ __**15 + 1**__ - 5 = 11\n\n⇒ __**16 - 5**__ = 11\n\n**⇒ 11 = 11 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 2) = and -\n\n10 = 3 ÷ 2 - 5 + 1 × 11 ⇒ 10 - 3 ÷ 2 = 5 + 1 × 11\n\n⇒ 10 - __**3 ÷ 2**__ = 5 + __**1 × 11**__\n\n⇒ __**10 - 1.5**__ = __**5 + 11**__\n\n⇒ 8.5 ≠ 16 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) × and ÷\n\n10 = 3 ÷ 2 - 5 + 1 × 11 ⇒ 10 = 3 × 2 - 5 + 1 ÷ 11\n\n⇒ 10 = 3 × 2 - 5 + __**1 **____**÷ 11**__\n\n⇒ 10 = __**3 **____**×**____** 2**__ - 5 + 0.09\n\n⇒ 10 = __**6 + 0.09**__ - 5 \n\n⇒ 10 = __**6.09 - 5**__\n\n⇒ 10 ≠ 1.09 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) + and -\n\n10 = 3 ÷ 2 - 5 + 1 × 11 ⇒ 10 = 3 ÷ 2 + 5 - 1 × 11\n\n⇒ 10 = __**3 ÷ 2**__ + 5 - 1 × 11\n\n⇒ 10 = 1.5 + 5 - __**1 × 11**__\n\n⇒ 10 = __**1.5 + 5**__ - 11\n\n⇒ 10 = 6.5 - 11\n\n⇒ 10 ≠ -4.5 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 1\" is the correct answer.",
